<div class="flex items-center justify-center min-h-screen bg-gray-900 p-4">
    <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 py-8 px-6 shadow-lg rounded-lg w-full max-w-3xl">

        {{!-- Header --}}
        <div class="mb-6 text-center">
            <div class="mx-auto h-12 mb-4">
                <Image src="/images/Travo-logo.png" @fallbackSrc="/images/Travo-logo.png" alt="Travo" width="160" height="56" class="w-40 mx-auto" />
            </div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">
                Privacy Policy
            </h2>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
                Effective Date: 11 May 2026 &nbsp;|&nbsp; Last Updated: 11 May 2026
            </p>
        </div>

        {{!-- Info Box --}}
        <div class="flex px-4 py-3 mb-6 rounded-md shadow-sm bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900/30 border border-blue-200 dark:border-blue-800">
            <div>
                <FaIcon @icon="shield-alt" @size="lg" class="text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-400 mr-4" />
            </div>
            <p class="flex-1 text-sm text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-300">
                This Privacy Policy explains how Travo.ng collects, uses, discloses, processes, stores, and protects your information. Designed to comply with NDPA, NDPR, GDPR, CCPA, Apple App Store, and Google Play policies.
            </p>
        </div>

        {{!-- Content --}}
        <div class="prose prose-sm max-w-none text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 space-y-6 overflow-y-auto" style="max-height: 60vh;">

            <section>
                <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">1. About Travo.ng</h3>
                <p>Travo.ng is a digital platform providing local and international logistics services, package delivery, courier services, freight forwarding, transportation and mobility services, e-commerce integrations, vendor fulfillment solutions, and payment-enabled booking and delivery services. Our services primarily operate in Nigeria, while also supporting international shipping and global commerce.</p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">2. Information We Collect</h3>
                <p class="font-semibold mb-1">A. Information You Provide Directly</p>
                <ul class="list-disc ml-5 space-y-1 mb-3">
                    <li>Full name, phone number, email address</li>
                    <li>Delivery and pickup addresses</li>
                    <li>Business/company information</li>
                    <li>Government-issued identification where required</li>
                    <li>Payment and shipping information</li>
                    <li>Driver, rider, or vendor registration details</li>
                    <li>Profile photographs or verification images</li>
                </ul>
                <p class="font-semibold mb-1">B. Automatically Collected Information</p>
                <ul class="list-disc ml-5 space-y-1 mb-3">
                    <li>Device identifiers, IP address, browser type, OS</li>
                    <li>Location data and GPS coordinates</li>
                    <li>Usage analytics, crash reports, and diagnostics</li>
                    <li>Cookies and similar technologies</li>
                </ul>
                <p class="font-semibold mb-1">C. Location Information</p>
                <p>We may collect real-time GPS location, approximate location, background location data (where enabled), and route/navigation information for delivery tracking, driver dispatch, fraud prevention, and route optimization. You may disable location permissions through device settings.</p>
                <p class="font-semibold mb-1 mt-2">D. Payment Information</p>
                <p>Payments may be processed by third-party payment providers. We collect transaction records, billing information, payment confirmations, and limited card metadata. We do not store full card numbers on our systems.</p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">3. How We Use Your Information</h3>
                <ul class="list-disc ml-5 space-y-1">
                    <li>Provide logistics, transportation, and booking services</li>
                    <li>Authenticate users and verify identities</li>
                    <li>Process payments and coordinate shipments</li>
                    <li>Improve platform performance and personalize experience</li>
                    <li>Prevent fraud, abuse, and monitor platform security</li>
                    <li>Send notifications, updates, and customer support</li>
                    <li>Comply with legal obligations and enforce Terms</li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">4. Legal Bases for Processing</h3>
                <ul class="list-disc ml-5 space-y-1">
                    <li>Contractual necessity</li>
                    <li>User consent</li>
                    <li>Legitimate business interests</li>
                    <li>Compliance with legal obligations</li>
                    <li>Protection of vital interests</li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">5. How We Share Information</h3>
                <p>We may share information with service providers (payment processors, cloud hosting, analytics, logistics partners), delivery and transportation partners (drivers, couriers, customs authorities) only to the extent necessary, and legal/regulatory authorities when required by law.</p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">6. International Data Transfers</h3>
                <p>Your information may be transferred to and processed in countries outside Nigeria. We implement standard contractual clauses, secure hosting arrangements, access controls, and data minimization measures as safeguards.</p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">7. Data Retention</h3>
                <p>We retain information only as long as necessary to provide services, comply with legal obligations, resolve disputes, enforce agreements, and maintain operational records. Retention periods vary depending on transaction history, financial regulations, and legal compliance requirements.</p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">8. Your Privacy Rights</h3>
                <ul class="list-disc ml-5 space-y-1">
                    <li>Access, correct, or delete your personal data</li>
                    <li>Restrict or object to processing</li>
                    <li>Withdraw consent or request data portability</li>
                    <li>Lodge complaints with regulators</li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">9. Cookies and Tracking Technologies</h3>
                <p>We use cookies, SDKs, pixels, local storage, and analytics technologies to authenticate users, improve functionality, analyze performance, remember preferences, and enhance security. You may manage cookies through browser settings.</p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">10. Mobile App Permissions</h3>
                <p>Our mobile apps may request location access, camera access, storage/file access, push notifications, phone/network access, and Bluetooth or nearby device access where applicable. Permissions are requested only when necessary for app functionality.</p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">11. Security Measures</h3>
                <p>We implement encryption, access controls, authentication procedures, secure servers, monitoring systems, fraud prevention systems, and role-based access limitations. However, no system is completely secure and we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">12. Children's Privacy</h3>
                <p>Travo.ng is not directed toward children under 13 years of age. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children without appropriate consent. If we become aware that such information has been collected, we will take reasonable steps to delete it.</p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">13. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h3>
                <p>We may update this Privacy Policy periodically. Updated versions will be posted on our website and mobile applications. Continued use of the Services after updates constitutes acceptance of the revised policy.</p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">14. Contact Information</h3>
                <p>For questions regarding this Privacy Policy or your personal data, contact:<br/>
                <strong>Travo.ng</strong><br/>
                Website: <a href="https://travo.ng" class="text-sky-600">https://travo.ng</a><br/>
                Email: privacy@travo.ng<br/>
                Support: support@travo.ng</p>
            </section>

        </div>

        {{!-- Footer --}}
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700">
            <LinkTo @route="terms-and-conditions" class="text-sm font-medium text-sky-600 hover:text-sky-500 transition-colors">
                Terms and Conditions
            </LinkTo>
            <LinkTo @route="auth.login" class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-500 hover:text-blue-500 transition-colors">
                Back to Sign In
            </LinkTo>
        </div>

    </div>
</div>